OL,3,GNEWSA'I've visited 50 places on extreme
OL,4,Aday trips'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has become hooked on extreme
OL,7,Fday-tripping, flying to about 50
OL,8,Fdestinations from Birmingham Airport.
OL,10,FAn extreme day trip is a travel trend
OL,11,Fwhere someone travels to a destination
OL,12,Fin a different country and returns home
OL,13,Fthe same day.
OL,15,FClaire Howard, a teacher from Solihull,
OL,16,Ftold BBC CWR that she has spent the day
OL,17,Fon the beaches of Benidorm, listening
OL,18,Fto French live music in Beauvais and
OL,19,Feating Italian food in Bergamo.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
